        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "仿佛 + comparison or proposition",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "仿佛 gives an impression or comparison as if something were true. It need not claim that the imagined situation is factual.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他仿佛没听见。",
                "pinyin": "tā fǎngfú méi tīngjiàn 。",
                "meaning": "It was as if he had not heard.",
                "audio": "6b9ef639f2883fd62d44611341742e2e296847b5e115869c48d64bd73e059377"
              },
              {
                "text": "这里仿佛是我的家。",
                "pinyin": "zhèlǐ fǎngfú shì wǒ de jiā 。",
                "meaning": "It feels as though this were my home.",
